{"server":"tw","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_05_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_05","title":"激變烽煙","storyCode":"BB-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"c4349545320fe1cc3a4e29ad64ed7b73a76185d8975881dfff539cc96655a238","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"內戰期間，為了巴別塔的理想而戰的特蕾西婭支持者在戰爭中大放異彩，戰爭的天平開始向巴別塔傾斜。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"1092年冬\n卡茲戴爾地區，邊境戰區"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些發瘋的瘤獸……是在遷徙？該死，不光前哨部隊被衝散了，那些沒來得及躲開的人，都……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那些完全沒有交流卻行動一致的巴別塔士兵……之前的情報裡可沒提過這些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我們該操心的問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我的職級最高，通知活著的人馬上歸隊收攏。這批物資很重要，沒了這些，我們這個冬天不會好過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉著的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是，長官。我們明明提前了這次行動，但還是出了問題，是不是那邊的內應——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"內應的情報沒問題。是負責協助運送物資的傭兵坐地起價耽誤了時間，人我已經處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我討厭傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多巧合……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧合每次都湊在一起就不是巧合了，這段時間我們莫名其妙吃的虧已經不少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"集中精神，巴別塔的人一定還在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，救——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道白芒貫穿了士兵的頭顱，在瘤獸急促的蹄聲中，他們甚至找不到攻擊的來源。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"清冷嘶啞的聲音在厄爾蘇拉的腦海中響起，毫無預兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉著的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……死了。*薩卡茲粗口*，我們得撤退，長官！你聽到那個聲音了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……他們在虛張聲勢。跟緊我的位置隱蔽前進！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人不許脫隊單獨行動！想活著就跟著大部隊一起行動！這批物資必須要送回！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄爾蘇拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於前哨部隊，他們只能自求多福了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們開始撤退了，果然想要直接拿下這批物資還是有困難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心中有數，Mantra女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra女士雙唇緊閉，但Scout的腦海中卻清晰地迴盪著她說話的聲音。\n或許在巴別塔隱秘行動小隊中，她是最完美的協調員。但Scout可以肯定，在敵人的心中，她會成為蠶食理智的陰影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵方前哨部隊已經被獸群成功切割，逃進了那片樹林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的行動是臨時起意，想必是意識到我們破解了他們的通訊暗號。但圍剿計劃還是成功了，滴水不漏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的就交給阿斯卡綸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸不會失敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，說的也是。休息會吧，Mantra女士，您“說話”的負擔太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的計劃不用擔心，我們有博士在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"媽的，誰在指揮作戰……又是惡靈？他究竟是哪個指揮官？哪個王庭的崽種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"他能如此對我們，總有一天也能如此對你們！給這種人賣命有什麼好處！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我會活著走出這裡——"},{"type":"narration","text":"傭兵聽到了不遠處黑暗中的呼吸，手中的刀毫無猶豫地揮斬出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你也受了這麼重的傷，你真有把握活著宰了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開，否則我拼了命也要宰了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能拿走馬塞爾的遺物。他得回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"家？咳咳，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的家在……卡茲戴爾！你們——背叛了卡茲戴爾……"},{"type":"narration","text":"傭兵的刀不斷向奧達揮去，但他只是竭力舉起自己的大錘抵擋。\n傭兵的動作越來越慢，氣息也越來越弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔……都是傻……子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……背叛了卡茲戴爾的，難道不是軍事委員會嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放鬆，他已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後下手要果斷些，這樣受傷會更少，奧達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這支隊伍全死了……他們應該有更榮譽的死法，而不是在恐懼的折磨裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要對敵人心軟，至少現在不要。帶上馬塞爾，我們的任務已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……還記得他的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會記著巴別塔的每一個人。活著的，死去的，有名字的，沒有名字的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來可以救下他……我只是很難做到……無所顧忌地向同族下手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是為了替馬塞爾報仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父親死在當年的城內亂局對吧……你想過替他報仇嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"奧達深深吸了一口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恨殺死他的人，但復仇不能改變任何事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很經典的論調，正義，合理，富有人文情懷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果你的仇人是個滿手鮮血、冷酷無情的劊子手呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會說，自己是因為正義和信念殺死的對方，而不帶仇恨色彩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸小姐，你會為殺死一位威脅巴別塔的傭兵而後悔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那我也不會後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我不得不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阿斯卡綸小姐！我又不知不覺說了些奇怪的話，我沒那麼重要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，巴別塔的每個人對殿下都很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lock_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾地區，巴別塔羅德島本艦"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你來幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過無數次，背叛殿下，是我自己的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"和軍事委員會無關，我也不是軍事委員會安排的內應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"軍法處置，給個痛快吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我沒打算來拷問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶了壺酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？這可是維多利亞的果酒，不是劣質私釀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……你到底來幹嘛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘敘舊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們無話可說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout沒告訴我全貌，問阿斯卡綸也不會說。她知道我們認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我猜，你想殺博士的原因無非幾種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那你猜猜看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是個輸不起的薩卡茲，所以你只是恨博士是個外族人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都希望巴別塔和軍事委員會有朝一日能和平相處，你覺得凱爾希醫生和博士沒有彌合這個裂縫，而是撕開了傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"知道還不滾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是外族人。不僅如此，我到今天還在為薩卡茲而戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍帽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"誰讓你不多帶個杯子，監獄裡難道有酒杯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你原本隊伍裡的其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我數數，一個長槍手，一個術師，你這個拿盾的，還有個醫療兵，和一個狙擊手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骷髏槍，白煙，灰陽，斯特羅斯，核桃，孔小姐，小草藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"原來那個弓箭手叫小草藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他死了，別記仇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"都是好戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果未來我手下也有年輕人，我會把他們培養成那樣的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無私，坦誠，勇猛，謹慎地選擇信念，義無反顧地奉獻自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。多愁善感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲就這麼痛恨巴別塔的外族人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"像你這種願意為特蕾西婭殿下賣命的蠢貨，很難理解那種心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"也許巴別塔確實在改變一些事，但沒有意義。不夠普遍，不夠快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但殿下本可以不用被絆住手腳，浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士幫了特蕾西婭議長很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……作為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"研究者？還是戰爭指揮官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕他葬送那麼多薩卡茲？這種人越多，戰爭越久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下很偉大，她一直在解決問題，解決了幾代人的衣食住行，現在又開始攻克礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"可現狀呢？我們現在在和軍事委員會打仗。在和自己人打仗。這和殿下的理想根本不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我差點忘了。你是個“雇傭兵”，但不是“薩卡茲雇傭兵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來只是陪著大家來到巴別塔。來蹚這渾水，只是因為隊伍裡的薩卡茲居多罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，白煙也死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛特地說起她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你們有戲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"人都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在特蕾西婭議長的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……媽的。該死。你這麼說，我都有點羡慕她了。什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場伏擊，我和她活到最後，她的腿被法術陷阱炸斷，我拖著她在泥地裡走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來，我們遇到了特蕾西婭議長。準確地說，先遇到了博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那個惡靈……啐，他還會親自上戰場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來你也許不信，遠遠望過去的時候，我還以為博士是拉特蘭的修士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他在黑色兜帽下祈禱。和發著亮的議長一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使沒有跪拜，沒有儀式，即使他只是平靜地與特蕾西婭議長看著遠方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你嘴裡的惡靈，Dr.{@nickname}，並不是一個無情的厲鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在被撕扯，在孤獨中徘徊，但他依舊選擇……為巴別塔帶來勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"搞了半天，你是來勸我的？就憑幾張感情牌？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"滾，拿走你的酒，你把我當什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，你不會這麼幼稚，不至於這麼看不起我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"做出決定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"死罪難逃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，博士和特蕾西婭議長都還在猶豫，但是凱爾希醫生和大部分參與行動的戰士都不想放過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你的背叛，我們間接損失了幾十位戰士，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我同意凱爾希醫生的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……嘖。再給我倒一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛把最後那點打翻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你來動手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來。沒必要讓Scout糾結，他看著狠，心裡軟。我也不想把你交給其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好兄弟，我廢話這麼幾句，只是想告訴你，也許你前些日子做了一件蠢事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但巴別塔會記住你的名字。我們會帶著你的警示和呵斥，繼續戰鬥下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲謀反者","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。記得早點挑幾個接班人培養起來，我看你這麼好心腸，死得也早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，在你們薩卡茲能平穩生活在大地上的那個日子到來的時候，我們再見吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g5_furnaceplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"處決了一批叛徒，以及間諜。王庭的間諜。他們氏族內部的麻煩還真不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。那支進入戰區的隊伍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"斥候去查了。他們襲擊了巴別塔的據點之後，封鎖了離開山脈的交通要道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍沒有下過命令，是某個王庭的親信……不，會是敘拉古家族的陰謀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"大概不是，根據目前的目擊情報，巫術沒有明顯的血統特徵，通訊也沒有像樣的密碼，是支雜牌軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……多嘴一句，長官，雖然這支隊伍不可控，但他們現在把巴別塔堵在了天災裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這對我們來說不是好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……其他指揮官和雇傭兵領袖怎麼看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"當然選擇隔岸觀火。敵人要不選擇投降，要不被天災和暴徒抹殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，別想太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"您下令撤出山谷，給他們留了退路，已經仁至義盡了。我很欽佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定我的家人也在那場天災之下呢。我都沒糾結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你不在乎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"盡量不去在乎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾地區，巴別塔羅德島本艦"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必再從頭複述了，Ace是被臨時召集的，跟著Mantra行動就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續吧，時不我待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況緊急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭示意）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在天災範圍內的巴別塔成員共有兩千五百餘人。醫療人員，感染者平民，俘虜和雇傭兵傷患居多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災的規模也比天災信使預計的更大。目前預計影響五座哨所，三條戰略要道，以及一座廢棄城鎮改建的臨時醫療據點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們本已快撤退到天災邊界，但有雇傭兵切斷了撤退路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把醫療人員、傷患和平民都關在天災下面等死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德現在這麼瘋狂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像他幹的，軍事委員會的三小股兵力已經撤離了森林，甚至刻意留了一條峽谷作為人道走廊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……峭壁上全是軍事委員會的術師。一旦發現有武裝力量，就直接撲滅在峽谷深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，軍事委員會的行蹤和目的都沒有打算遮掩，都在預計之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這些突然出現，襲擊據點的雇傭兵，他們直接炸毀了交通要道和橋樑，還用源石炸藥污染了山脈裡的數處水源，毫無目的性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇主是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在查。但根據為數不多的情報推測，他們很可能……無主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出於某種純粹的報復，或是被特雷西斯拋棄後的掙扎，以及其他國家的煽動，都有可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無所謂。他們的領袖，我去問，我去殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失去領袖，沒有目標的雇傭兵就是烏合之眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們救人，我們在據點會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後轉達一句話，殿下說了，這次行動並不是“戰役”的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至該鬆口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在逐漸膠著的戰場上，對抗的雙方又有了一次齊心協力的機會，且只為了一個目的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從天災下，拯救生命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
